====================================================================================================
  mu = kappa (relaxation tight): 465   parity signatures: {'2odd+2even': 218, '3odd+1even': 112, '1odd+3even': 120, '4odd+0even': 15}
  mu > kappa (relaxation strict): 14   parity signatures: {'3odd+1even': 8, '2odd+2even': 6}

  mu > kappa examples (optimum NOT a rotation slab):
